WEBVTT

00:00:02.221 --> 00:00:03.528
Charming woman.

00:00:05.281 --> 00:00:06.568
I was 16.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:08.810
Where did you go?

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:12.496
Round your dad's.

00:00:13.998 --> 00:00:15.542
I was always welcome at the Potters'.

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:19.331
I see him so much in you, Harry.

00:00:20.796 --> 00:00:22.387
You are so very much alike.

00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:24.957
I'm not so sure.

00:00:26.969 --> 00:00:28.429
Sirius, when I was....

00:00:31.307 --> 00:00:34.651
When I saw Mr. Weasley attacked,
I wasn't just watching.

00:00:36.938 --> 00:00:37.959
I was the snake.

00:00:39.315 --> 00:00:42.234
And afterwards, in Dumbledore's office...

00:00:42.401 --> 00:00:45.614
...there was a moment
when I wanted to--

00:00:51.744 --> 00:00:54.622
This connection
between me and Voldemort.

00:00:55.331 --> 00:00:58.876
What if the reason for it
is that I am becoming more like him?

00:01:00.211 --> 00:01:04.392
I just feel so angry all the time.

00:01:05.341 --> 00:01:08.975
And what if, after everything
that I've been through...

00:01:10.012 --> 00:01:13.599
...something's gone wrong inside me?
What if I'm becoming bad?

00:01:16.227 --> 00:01:18.330
I want you to listen to me
very carefully, Harry.

00:01:20.648 --> 00:01:22.941
You're not a bad person.

00:01:24.485 --> 00:01:27.574
You're a very good person
who bad things have happened to.

00:01:29.448 --> 00:01:30.574
You understand?

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:37.707
Besides, the world isn't split
into good people and Death Eaters.

00:01:37.873 --> 00:01:41.198
We've all got both light and dark
inside of us.

00:01:43.087 --> 00:01:45.312
What matters
is the part we choose to act on.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.944
That's who we really are.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.590
Harry, time to go.

00:01:57.893 --> 00:02:01.128
When all this is over,
we'll be a proper family.

00:02:02.314 --> 00:02:03.899
You'll see.

00:02:05.026 --> 00:02:06.402
Come on.

00:02:43.856 --> 00:02:45.024
Really?

00:02:45.191 --> 00:02:46.998
Harry. Harry.

00:02:47.675 --> 00:02:49.085
Hagrid's back.

00:02:52.865 --> 00:02:54.300
I'm sorry.

00:03:08.964 --> 00:03:10.903
I will say this one last time.

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:14.762
I'm ordering you to tell me
where you've been.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:17.973
I told you. I've been away for me health.

00:03:18.265 --> 00:03:21.806
-Your health?
-Yeah. Bit of fresh air, you know.

00:03:22.603 --> 00:03:26.933
Oh, yes. As gamekeeper,
fresh air must be difficult to come by.

00:03:29.485 --> 00:03:31.987
If I were you,
I shouldn't get too used to being back.

00:03:32.154 --> 00:03:35.491
In fact, I mightn't bother
unpacking at all.

00:03:54.385 --> 00:03:56.443
This is top-secret, right?

00:03:58.389 --> 00:04:00.766
Dumbledore sent me
to parley with the giants.

00:04:00.843 --> 00:04:02.144
- Giants?
- Shh.

00:04:03.602 --> 00:04:04.645
You found them?

00:04:04.812 --> 00:04:08.732
Well, they're not that hard to find, to be
perfectly honest. They're so big, see?

00:04:09.608 --> 00:04:12.213
I tried to convince them
to join the cause.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:15.261
But I wasn't the only one
that was trying to win them over.

00:04:16.198 --> 00:04:17.697
- Death Eaters?
- Yes.

00:04:18.576 --> 00:04:21.232
Trying to persuade them
to join You-Know-Who.

00:04:22.413 --> 00:04:24.790
-Did they?
-I gave them Dumbledore's message.

00:04:24.957 --> 00:04:28.014
Suppose some of them remember
he was friendly to them. I suppose.

00:04:32.548 --> 00:04:33.883
And they did this to you?

00:04:34.508 --> 00:04:35.551
Not exactly, no.

00:04:36.927 --> 00:04:39.973
Oh, go on, you have it, then,
you dozy dog.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.167
It's changing out there.

00:04:57.364 --> 00:04:58.949
Just like last time.

00:05:00.409 --> 00:05:01.817
There's a storm coming, Harry.

00:05:02.786 --> 00:05:05.003
We'd all best be ready when she does.

